  "step_1": "The decision reason can be applied to the decision problem. The reason focuses on losses and specifically the maximum loss of each lottery, treating losses as more important than gains. It prefers the lottery with the more favorable (i.e., less severe) maximum loss. In this case: Lottery A has a maximum loss of -3000 Euros with 100% probability. Lottery B has a maximum loss of -4000 Euros with 80% probability. The more favorable maximum loss is therefore in Lottery A (-3000 vs. -4000). Thus, the decision reason would prefer Lottery A.",
